# ============================================
# .gitignore for Orkideya ASP.NET Core Project
# ============================================

## Build outputs
bin/
obj/

## User-specific files
*.user
*.suo
.vs/

## ASP.NET - Secrets & Connection Strings (DO NOT COMMIT)
**/appsettings.json
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Production.json
**/appsettings.Staging.json

## Secrets and certificates (DO NOT COMMIT)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.preview.env
*.pfx
*.pem
*.key

## Database files
*.mdf
*.ldf
*.db
*.sqlite

## Published output
**/publish/
**/PublishProfiles/

## NuGet packages
*.nupkg
packages/
.nuget/

## Logs
Logs/
*.log

## OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

## Rider / JetBrains
.idea/

## Visual Studio Code
.vscode/

## Entity Framework migrations - keep if needed but exclude temp
# Migrations/

## wwwroot uploads (product images - large files)
**/wwwroot/images/products/

# Local SDKs, private exports and test output
.local-tools/
**/App_Data/
**/wwwroot/*.xlsx
**/TestResults/

/frontend/node_modules/
/frontend/.nuxt/
/frontend/.output/
